OL,3,ATrump welcomes Xi to Washington as his
OL,4,Atrade secretary says US and China agree
OL,5,Ato extend trade truce
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump has welcomed Xi Jinping at
OL,8,Fthe airport with a red carpet and
OL,9,Fmilitary flyover to kick off a historic
OL,10,Fthree-day US visit
OL,12,FAfter shaking hands during a brief -
OL,13,Fbut ornate - greeting, Trump and Xi
OL,14,Fdeparted Joint Base Andrews en route
OL,15,Ffor Washington DC
OL,17,FElsewhere, US Treasury Secretary Scott
OL,18,FBessent has announced that the US and
OL,19,FChina will extend their trade truce to
OL,20,FJanuary - it was set to expire in
OL,21,FNovember
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
